      "created_at": "2022-10-07T22:59:11.055Z",
      "cooked": "<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/boom.png?v=12\" title=\":boom:\" class=\"emoji only-emoji\" alt=\":boom:\"><strong>THIS WEEK</strong> only <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/bangbang.png?v=12\" title=\":bangbang:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":bangbang:\"> The Bloodsworn Colosseum floats up to a Mobile Defense Platform near you! Are you not entertained?!</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f23eaa347cc0fe16d998f84e85db088874eff7b6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/f23eaa347cc0fe16d998f84e85db088874eff7b6\" title=\"20221007094217_1\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f23eaa347cc0fe16d998f84e85db088874eff7b6_2_690x388.jpeg\" alt=\"20221007094217_1\" data-base62-sha1=\"yyZO0X1PHdc4by2P3Ex0b5c01QW\" width=\"690\" height=\"388\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f23eaa347cc0fe16d998f84e85db088874eff7b6_2_690x388.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f23eaa347cc0fe16d998f84e85db088874eff7b6_2_1035x582.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f23eaa347cc0fe16d998f84e85db088874eff7b6_2_1380x776.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/f/f23eaa347cc0fe16d998f84e85db088874eff7b6_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">20221007094217_1</span><span class=\"informations\">1920×1080 365 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>The crowd remained pumped up most of the match, especially when Kaargra joined the fight near the beginning. The Fickle Fans gave the heroes a boost early on, but later evened out a 10 point lead. I always feel like it’s a happy accident when I win one of these, because there are so many moving parts to keep track of. Mostly focused on flipping Kaargra back, and got ol’ meatshield Legacy to be immune to melee and soak up most of the punches to prevent the Bloodsworn favor from skyrocketing. Didn’t get that many titles for the heroes, but it didn’t make much difference after all.</p>",
